# `TwistedFrobeniusHopf` — Root Module

Standalone Lean Reservoir library: Nakayama-twisted Frobenius algebras, Sweedler H_4 and Taft Hopf algebras, Higman norm map, and ambidextrous adjunctions.

Individual modules are built via `globs = ["TwistedFrobeniusHopf", "TwistedFrobeniusHopf.+"]` in `lakefile.toml`; import targeted `TwistedFrobeniusHopf.<Module>` submodules directly rather than this root.
